    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Property Partners Moore Larkin are delighted to launch to the market No. 121 Monksfield, a wonderful two bedroom ground floor apartment which is presented in excellent decorative order throughout. This superb apartment would be ideal for those wishing to trade down, first time buyers or indeed investors alike.\n\nThe apartment is ready to occupy and offers well proportioned rooms throughout. Two bedrooms (master bedroom en-suite), both with fitted storage units, open plan lounge, kitchen/dining area and the main bathroom completes the accommodation. Measuring 64 sq.m / 688 sq. ft approximately.\n\nIdeally positioned end of unit apartment, with excellent car parking.\n\nVIEWINGS ARE HIGHLY RECOMMENDED."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Notice\nPlease note we have not tested any apparatus, fixtures, fittings, or services. Interested parties must undertake their own investigation into the working order of these items. All measurements are approximate and photographs provided for guidance only."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li> Two bedroom ground floor, end of unit apartment. </li><li> Measuring 64 sq.m / 688 sq. ft approximately. </li><li> Presented in excellent condition. </li><li> Clever and convenient outdoor storage. </li><li> Ample car parking. </li><li> Gas Fired Central Heating - \"Hive\" System. </li><li> Minutes to Supervalu, Cunningham`s Pharmacy & The Athlone Springs Hotel. </li><li> Ideal home / investment opportunity. </li><li> Own door apartment. </li><li> BER C.</li></ul>"
      },
